>what should I be looking for on ebay? :-)

Be careful to get a TLZ SBB that has a 16-bit tolerant wire to the
backplane. There are models out there that effectively short the higher
8-bits of a wide (BA356) bus to ground. This makes all your wide-SCSI
devices go away rather quickly ;-)

